guide nood/06-25-30
title 25-30 Nood: Excavation Site, Dalaran
levels 25-30
zone map 1440
faction Horde
folder Nood Guide
why Dungeon-focused leveling. When you reach a dungeon's level you run it first, then do only the most efficient zone quests until the next dungeon. 25-30: Ashenvale, Hillsbrad and Arathi -> The Excavation Site: Wetlands at 27 -> zo…
coords era
next nood/07-30-40
